ROOM CORRIDOR A LONG CORRIDOR. THE LAB IS NORTH, THE OFFICE WEST AND THE STORE ROOM EAST.
ROOM LAB THE COMPUTER LAB. A COMP80 SITS ON THE BENCH, ITS SCREEN DARK.
ROOM OFFICE THE TECHNICIAN'S OFFICE, WITH A DESK AND A DRAWER.
ROOM STORE A CRAMPED STORE ROOM, ITS SHELVES FULL OF PARTS.
EXIT CORRIDOR N LAB
EXIT LAB S CORRIDOR
EXIT CORRIDOR W OFFICE
EXIT OFFICE E CORRIDOR
EXIT CORRIDOR E STORE IF UNLOCKED
EXIT STORE W CORRIDOR
FIX COMP80 LAB A COMP80 WITH ITS LID OFF AND AN EMPTY FUSE HOLDER.
FIX DRAWER OFFICE A DESK DRAWER.
FIX DOOR CORRIDOR THE STORE ROOM DOOR.
OBJ TAPE OFFICE A CASSETTE MARKED LIFE.
OBJ KEY NOWHERE A SMALL KEY.
OBJ FUSE STORE A FUSE.
ON OPEN DRAWER IF NOT OPENED THEN SAY INSIDE IS A SMALL KEY.; MOVE KEY OFFICE; SET OPENED
ON OPEN DRAWER THEN SAY IT IS EMPTY NOW.
ON UNLOCK DOOR IF HAVE KEY AND HERE DOOR THEN SAY THE DOOR CLICKS OPEN.; SET UNLOCKED; SCORE 10
ON UNLOCK DOOR THEN SAY YOU HAVE NO KEY.
ON FIT FUSE IF HAVE FUSE AND AT LAB THEN SAY THE SCREEN GLOWS AND SAYS READY.; MOVE FUSE GONE; SET FIXED; SCORE 10
ON LOAD TAPE IF FIXED AND HAVE TAPE AND AT LAB THEN SAY GLIDERS SAIL ACROSS THE SCREEN. THE COMP80 LIVES!; SCORE 10; WIN
ON LOAD TAPE THEN SAY THERE IS NOTHING TO LOAD IT INTO.
